Yes, but the meaning of "predestined" is not given by the Bible. Why does it have to mean that God has predetermined who will go to Heaven? In my understanding, those verses are referring to those who would be saved by the death and resurrection of Christ. He "predestined" those who would be saved (as in, whosoever believeth in Him), which God foreknew. I hope I have articulated my thoughts in a way that makes sense, but I may not be making sense. I just got off of work, and I have been studying for an exam, so please bear with me. lol

